        "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>when fighting Progeny does incapacitated heroes count when determining if Progeny flips?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Apostate gauntlets activate when target actually takes damage or whenever Apoatate deals damage?</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
