        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bullfroggy95/{size}/2022_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-02T19:55:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hold on, there is an exception to the Progeny Question. If Sky-Scraper is incapped in Huge Form and uses her ability to become a 1 HP indestructible target, Progeny will not flip back regardless of anyone else being higher than 10 because she is a Hero Character card with less than 10 HP. But asides from that one case, he will flip back if all other heroes have more than 10 HP when he incaps a Hero from berserking on them.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:58:48.572Z",
